#30900
Outside the Inn~
   You are outside a large, two-story building which proports to be 'FairHaven
Inn' on a brightly lettered sign out front.  You hear laughing and revelry from
inside -- sounds like a lively place.  The main doors are directly south of
you, and small paths lead east and west around the building.  Eastward is
another smaller building; obviously a stable.  Northward is the main road,
providing all the traffic and customers for this establishment.    
~
